<title>USA: Mosinee to spend $7 million on expansion.</title>
<headline>Mosinee to spend $7 million on expansion.</headline>
<dateline>MOSINEE, Wis. 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mosinee Paper Corp said Monday its board of directors has approved a $7 million paper machine capacity expansion at its Sorg Paper facility in Middletown, Ohio.</p>
<p>The project is expected to be completed by early summer 1998 and includes equipment modificaitons on a paper machine that will increase capacity more than 25 percent and improve the quality of the paper produced.</p>
<p>Mosinee shares were down 7/16 at 24 Monday.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
